# Decision Integrity

- Always separate `Confirmed`, `Assumption`, `Risk`, `Deferred`, and `Open Question` when discussing architecture, workflow, or product direction.
- Do not invent unverified capabilities.
- Do not present desktop-shell roadmap ideas as already implemented.
- Do not silently convert reference artifacts into editable source-of-truth files.
